WEBVTT

00:21:58.079 --> 00:22:01.163
Movie going is in many
ways a sacred ritual,

00:22:01.746 --> 00:22:04.871
repeated week after week after week.

00:22:06.079 --> 00:22:07.079
I'll be there this weekend,

00:22:07.829 --> 00:22:12.538
just like I was on most weekends between
the years of 1996 and 1990 at

00:22:12.538 --> 00:22:13.913
the multiplex near the shopping mall,

00:22:13.913 --> 00:22:16.413
about five miles from my childhood
home in Columbus, Georgia.

00:22:17.788 --> 00:22:20.788
The funny thing is that somewhere
between then and now,

00:22:21.371 --> 00:22:23.288
I accidentally changed part of

00:22:23.288 --> 00:22:25.329
the conversation about which
of those movies get made.

00:22:26.163 --> 00:22:29.163
You obviously gave that talk well
before the pandemic or any of

00:22:29.163 --> 00:22:31.746
the current concerns about movie theaters
and public health existed.